0 Two broad light guides sweep around a compact, symmetrical frame of axle joiners, cross blocks and hanging levers.
0 Name: FIBER_OPTICS_CABLE_WIDE-Constraints.ldr
0 Author: Jetro de Chateau
0 Unofficial Model
0 // Scene: Blue and yellow loops bend outward from two upper fittings, then turn inward near the lower levers. A horizontal perforated beam spans the small rigid frame behind them.
0 // Rigid construction: The mirrored fittings combine 6538a joiners, 32062 short axles, 32184 and 32291 cross blocks, 6536 connectors, 2853 crank pieces and a 40490 beam.
0 // Build lesson: Study the small rigid offset assemblies and their paired layout as ideas for an instrument bracket, cable guide or compact service head.
0 // Reuse: 4173497.dat is unresolved in the local library, so the larger parent unit is absent from the preview. The visible linkage does not establish the complete device or its operation.
